# Physically based daylight: Rayleigh-scattered sunlight, computed wavelength by wavelength.
# atmosphere <sun elevation degrees> [sun azimuth, from -z towards +x] [exposure]
atmosphere 42 25 1.0
camera 0 1.6 7  0 1.2 0  40
image 640 360 96
floor 8 0.8 0.05
sphere 0 1 0 1 glass SF11
sphere 2.3 0.55 1.0 0.55 glass DIAMOND
sphere -2.2 0.7 0.8 0.7 glass N-BK7
sphere -0.8 0.45 2.4 0.45 mirror 0.92